## Apply Progress — Contract Hardening Micro-Apply

### Batch Scope
- Clean up verify WARNING #1 by making Web Push quiet-hours payload contract explicit and safer.

### Completed in This Batch
- [x] Added/updated tests first for explicit contract and fallback behavior in `serviceWorker.test.ts`.
